-    - bg = most common border color. Several hollow sprites sit away from the palette.
-    - A 2xN or Nx2 palette block lies on one grid edge; its outer line lists sprite border colors and its inner line lists the partner colors for those borders.
+    - The boundary-most color is the background, with several hollow single-color sprites placed away from the edge.
+    - One 2×N or N×2 legend lies on a grid edge; its outer line lists candidate sprite-border colors and its inner line lists the replacement border colors.
 
     Rule:
-    - Locate the palette and read it as a border->partner mapping.
